Chapter: PunctualLaunderUnary

 Probe (closed by the punctual FIX campaign): the call and allocation
 walks now cover every expression shape, matching the cycle
 collector's coverage. The negated call to a non-punctual recursive
 function is CDX6001; the negated list literal is a heap allocation,
 CDX6002. list-length itself stays allowlisted - the emitter proves
 it a single header load.

Section: Definitions

  slow-sum : Integer -> Integer
  slow-sum (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else n + slow-sum (n - 1)

  punctual spend : Integer -> Integer
  spend (x) = -(slow-sum x) + -(list-length [x, x])

  opening : Text = show (spend 9)

